<title>POLAND: Agros trades off the floor at PLN 71.</title>
<headline>Agros trades off the floor at PLN 71.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two kerb transactions of 75,000 and 140,000 shares in food trader Agros Holding SA at 71 zlotys a share were struck through the Warsaw bourse on Monday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular bourse session Agros rose 3.3 percent to 77.5 zlotys in a volume of 8,651 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
